--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. Imported upstream code — its own terms still apply
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Parts of this repository were imported from HMPanel
(https://github.com/neoauroraproject/hmpanel). Section 1 covers the HMray Panel
work only. It does not relicense the imported files and it does not grant rights
that the upstream author never granted.

  a) Code imported from HMPanel **v2.5.20 and earlier** was published by
     upstream under the MIT License, so its MIT terms apply to those files. The
     upstream copyright notice stays with them.

  b) Code imported from HMPanel **v2.5.21 through v3.0.1** ships upstream with
     no LICENSE file and with `backend/package.json` marked `"UNLICENSED"`. It
     is redistributed here under the separate permission recorded in
     `NOTICE.md`. Copyright in those files remains with the upstream author and
     no additional rights to them are granted by this file.

If you reuse this repository, keep `NOTICE.md` with it: it records what came
from where.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. Not included
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The upstream product sells a separate **Premium** edition. Its code is not part
of this repository: it is delivered at runtime as a bundle by the vendor's
license server and is gated by `backend/src/common/guards/premium.guard.ts`. No
premium material from the vendor is redistributed here.
